{"id":"30c9caa6f210ffe7","group":"56","path":"56/56-lem-sr-measure-well-founded.md","title":"SR测度严格序良基","display":"lem-sr-measure-well-founded — SR测度严格序良基","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-lem-sr-measure-well-founded","aliases":["56-lem-sr-measure-well-founded"],"display":"lem-sr-measure-well-founded — SR测度严格序良基","depends_on":["[[56-df-sr-measure]]"],"source_section":"§8.5 Definition 8.5.17; Appendix A Lemma A.1.16","source_printed_pages":"369","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-local-interface","source_proof_status":"read-source-proof-and-local-derivation; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-lem-sr-measure-well-founded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-lem-sr-measure-well-founded</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-sr-measure-well-founded — SR测度严格序良基"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0beba8c2f97bc27f\" href=\"?note=0beba8c2f97bc27f\" title=\"56-df-sr-measure\">56-df-sr-measure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.5 Definition 8.5.17; Appendix A Lemma A.1.16"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"369"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-local-interface"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-source-proof-and-local-derivation; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,\\triangleleft_{SR},\\unlhd_{SR}\">\\(\\mathcal M,\\triangleleft_{SR},\\unlhd_{SR}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0beba8c2f97bc27f\" href=\"?note=0beba8c2f97bc27f\" title=\"56-df-sr-measure\">56-df-sr-measure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega=\\mathbb N\">\\(\\omega=\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal M\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(a(i+1)\\triangleleft_{SR}a(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal M\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(a(i+1)\\triangleleft_{SR}a(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in\\mathcal M\\;((0)\\unlhd_{SR}a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in\\mathcal M\\;((0)\\unlhd_{SR}a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若有无限下降链，第一分量是自然数的非增序列，只能有限次严格下降，于某时稳定于n。其后得到固定n个自然数的严格字典序无限下降链；按n归纳：第一个变化分量只能有限次下降，稳定后余n−1个分量仍无限下降，矛盾。n=0时只有元组(0)。不把任意长自然数串的普通字典序误当作良基；长度首分量不可省。来源为正文明确引用的有限字典积良基事实；此处给本地完整短证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-sr-measure","status":"resolved","id":"0beba8c2f97bc27f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-sr-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-sr-measure","status":"resolved","id":"0beba8c2f97bc27f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal M,\\triangleleft_{SR},\\unlhd_{SR}$ 采用 [[56-df-sr-measure]]。$\\omega=\\mathbb N$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M,\\triangleleft_{SR},\\unlhd_{SR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega=\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal M\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(a(i+1)\\triangleleft_{SR}a(i)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in\\mathcal M\\;((0)\\unlhd_{SR}a).","display":true}],"bytes":1415,"backlinks":[{"id":"475d1dab5264244e","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$\\Pi\\in\\mathcal P_R$ 满足 $\\operatorname{CleanNF}_R(\\Pi)$；$s=S(\\Pi)$，$z=T(\\Pi)$，$P=\\operatorname{TPos}(z)$。$a=(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R$。$\\nu_{SR},A_R,\\operatorname{PWit}_R$ 见 [[56-df-needed-sr-measure]]，提取、Rpc、nonneeded保持见 [[56-lem-needed-reduction-extraction]]、[[56-lem-needed-prefix-rpc]]、[[56-lem-nonneeded-preserves-needed-prefix]]；指定残余图及良基测度见 [[56-thm-complete-development-diamond]]、[[56-lem-residual-parallel-moves]]、[[56-lem-sr-measure-well-founded]]；模式的静态残余传送与无收缩命中时的动态传送见 [[56-lem-redex-pattern-static-transport]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-lem-sr-measure-well-founded.md]]"},{"id":"efe12b141b93e7e9","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$\\operatorname{Std}_R,\\operatorname{PStd}_R$ 见 [[56-df-standard-labelled-reduction]]；$\\operatorname{wit}_R,\\approx_R$ 分别取 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]、[[56-df-proofterm-permutation]] 的具体归约见证与置换等价。有限证明项的归约化见 [[56-lem-proofterm-serialization]]，SR测度及其良基性见 [[56-df-sr-measure]]、[[56-lem-sr-measure-well-founded]]；标准路径的单元素平行化保持标准性见 [[56-lem-standard-implies-parallel-standard]]。"},{"id":"58edeb4b336cf785","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统；无限路径断言的序列变量在 Assertion 内独立有界量化。$\\operatorname{InfHyperNeeded}_R$、$\\operatorname{HyperNormalizingNeeded}_R$、$\\mathrm{WNAt}$ 见 [[56-df-needed-reduction-paths]]。正规形路径的clean提取、单步投影、$\\nu_{SR}$ 与 $\\triangleleft_{SR}$ 的良基性分别见 [[56-lem-needed-reduction-extraction]]、[[56-lem-needed-sr-projection]]、[[56-lem-sr-measure-well-founded]] 及其上游。"}],"outgoing":["0beba8c2f97bc27f"]}